@* A section RCL does NOT inherit the host's Views/_ViewImports.cshtml. Omitting a line
   here ships broken markup with a green build — guarded by TourPageRenderTests.
   The Humans.Base line looks unused but is load-bearing: its NonceTagHelper stamps the
   CSP nonce on every <script>, including _TourLayout's inline tour-js script; without it
   the browser blocks that script and the page silently stops animating.
   No localizer binding: Tour is deliberately English-only (spec 2026-08-12). *@
@using Humans.Tour
@using Humans.Tour.Controllers
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
@addTagHelper *, Humans.Base
